{
  "name": "@gamedna/kit",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "GameDNA Kit: tested, reusable game code for browser games. Portable modules (random, loop, input, collision, controllers, vehicle handling, AI, navigation, events, saves, inventory, rooms, pooling, budgets, feedback, contracts) and three.js presentation (camera, character, vehicle, world, stage, disposal). Written for GameDNA; not an engine.",
